    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/vw-taxi-booking/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Take your taxi business online with the VW Taxi Booking Theme, specially crafted for cab companies, ride-hailing services, car rental businesses, airport transfers, private taxi operators, chauffeur services, and other transportation providers. This theme seamlessly integrates ecommerce functionality for selling travel passes, corporate ride packages, subscription rides, and online booking services through WooCommerce, making it perfect for digital taxi platforms and service-based online stores. With its responsive, mobile-friendly design, the theme offers professional layouts for online taxi booking systems, fleet showcases, vehicle listings, driver profiles, fare calculators, instant ride reservations, and secure payment options. It also includes Contact Form 7 for customer inquiries and booking requests, and Yoast SEO to enhance visibility for terms like taxi booking service, cab booking online, airport pickup, city taxi rides, and car hire. Featuring real-time availability updates, flexible ride scheduling, fast-loading performance, intuitive navigation, and customizable pre-built pages, the VW Taxi Booking Theme provides a conversion-focused platform that streamlines operations, boosts bookings, improves customer experience, and establishes a strong online presence for taxi startups and modern transportation businesses. Demo: https://www.vwthemes.net/vw-taxi-booking-pro/"
    },
